        <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:selichot/penitential_fifth_day/shuv_meharon">
          <tei:pb n="144" ed="1912" facs="https://archive.org/download/selichothdavidasher1912/page/n290_medium.jpg"/>
          <tei:p>Return from thy fierce wrath, and alter the evil decree concerning thy people. Turn us, O God of our salvation, and cause thine anger toward us to cease. Return, O Lord, unto the many thousands of Israel! Take with you words, and turn to the Lord; say unto him, take away all iniquity and receive us graciously; so will we render the calves of our lips. </tei:p>
        </tei:div>
