        <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:selichot/penitential_fifth_day/tavo_lefanekha">
          <tei:pb n="145" ed="1912" facs="https://archive.org/download/selichothdavidasher1912/page/n292_medium.jpg"/>
          <tei:p>Let our prayer come before thee; and hide not thyself from our supplication. Let the sighing of the prisoner come before thee; according to the greatness of thy power preserve thou those that are appointed to die. Thou shalt arise and have mercy upon Zion, for the time to favour her, yea, the set time is come. </tei:p>
        </tei:div>
